# Ignore large media and binary files to save tokens and search time
*.fbx
*.obj
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tga
*.tif
*.psd
*.exr

# Audio
*.mp3
*.wav
*.ogg
*.aif

# Video
*.mp4
*.webm
*.avi

# Ignore meta files by default from text search (we only look at them when specifically tracing GUIDs)
*.meta

# Compiled fonts
*.ttf
*.otf

# You might want to ignore large YAML files from general grep searches
# and instead use the MCP bridge to query Prefabs and Scenes.
*.prefab
*.unity
*.asset

# Ignore standard third-party directories where we shouldn't edit code
Assets/Plugins/
Packages/
